                            dataObjectRef="_e641f512-c40f-4799-b5ec-88bb2c4bf7e9">
         <documentation id="documentation_e641f512-c40f-4799-b5ec-88bb2c4bf7e9"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Purpose: Persistent operational record used to track daily valuation populations, processing progress, control results and exceptions through successful completion or a documented unsuccessful outcome.
 
Contents: Valuation date and population identifiers, file references, current processing status, control and reconciliation results, exception classification, assigned owner, required next action, escalation status, relevant timestamps and final outcome.
 
Usage: Read when confirming the valuation population and reconciling processing results. Updated when the processing state changes or when an unresolved valuation exception is documented, assigned and escalated. Supports operational monitoring, recovery coordination and audit traceability.]]></documentation>
