Trigger: A corrected and controlled FAP valuation file is ready for resubmission.
 
Handling: Transfer process control to the corresponding catching link event without introducing a long cross-model sequence flow.
 
Output: The valuation submission retry continues at the SYS-FAP upload activity.]]></documentation>
