      <intermediateCatchEvent name="RECHECK_ACCOUNTING_AND_NAV_IMPACT"
                               id="_2fb0e3a8-3ed1-4c91-b461-6c225104443e">
         <documentation id="documentation_2fb0e3a8-3ed1-4c91-b461-6c225104443e"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Trigger: Invoked by the corresponding throwing link event after implementation of an accounting valuation or NAV corrective action.
 
Handling: Resume the current process instance at the accounting and NAV impact review activity.
 
Output: Process control passes to Review unrealised P&L and derivative accounting impact.]]></documentation>
