      <manualTask name="Document and escalate the unresolved accounting or NAV impact"
                   id="_41f0e4e8-9971-41bd-9418-1f5b253c9aca"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_41f0e4e8-9971-41bd-9418-1f5b253c9aca"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Input:  Accounting or NAV impact that remains unresolved before the applicable NAV cut-off.
 
Handling: Record the affected valuation population, accounts and positions, assessed materiality, unresolved impact, supporting evidence, implemented recovery attempts, assigned owner and required next action. Update the operational lifecycle tracker and notify the required operational and oversight stakeholders.
 
Output: Updated operational status, valuation exception record, investigation evidence and documented escalation supporting the unsuccessful valuation outcome.]]></documentation>
