Trigger: Invoked by the corresponding throwing link event after preparation of a corrected FAP valuation file.
 
Handling: Resume the current process instance as the SYS-FAP upload stage.
 
Output: Process control passes to Upload the valuation file to SYS-FAP.]]></documentation>
