      <manualTask name="Prepare the corrected FAP valuation file for resubmission"
                   id="_6e947f62-5b5d-41c1-82b2-babb2c194787"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_6e947f62-5b5d-41c1-82b2-babb2c194787"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Input: Corrected or resubmittable valuation data, the updated valuation exception record and the approved FAP valuation template.
 
Handling: Rebuild the FAP valuation file for the affected population. Reapply the required mapping, formatting and control checks, preserve traceability to the original submission and identify the file as a controlled resubmission.
 
Output: Prepared FAP valuation file ready for controlled resubmission to SYS-FAP.]]></documentation>
