      <manualTask name="Identify normal and exception valuation populations"
                   id="_71bb89ce-ea91-4ccc-8364-2c5f4416bb2c"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_71bb89ce-ea91-4ccc-8364-2c5f4416bb2c"><![CDATA[Input: Processable scheduled valuation file, population-comparison results, current SYS-FAP accounting-position state, and operational lifecycle information.
 
Handling: Assess the expected trade, version, and valuation-date population. Identify missing, stale, duplicate, rejected, unknown-trade, and historical-version valuations while separating records suitable for normal processing.
 
Output: Accepted valuation population and separately identified valuation exceptions requiring review. Both populations may exist within the same daily cycle.]]></documentation>
