      <manualTask name="Ivestigate rejected, unapplied or inconsistent valuations"
                   id="_7374c9ed-3d96-4e74-8ae1-cbb1b0e13603"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_7374c9ed-3d96-4e74-8ae1-cbb1b0e13603"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Input: FAP valuation processing results and the corresponding SYS-FAP accounting and position state for the submitted valuation population.
 
Handling: Compare the submitted, accepted, rejected and applied records. Identify rejected, unapplied or inconsistent valuations, determine the affected population and establish whether the cause relates to source data, mapping, validation or posting. Record the current processing state, assigned owner and required recovery action.
 
Output: Classified valuation exception record identifying the affected valuations, exception category, processing status, owner and required recovery action.]]></documentation>
