      <manualTask name="Coordinate and implement the agreed corrective action"
                   id="_9938135b-cdd1-43ea-8ee9-dbe5f99705c7"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_9938135b-cdd1-43ea-8ee9-dbe5f99705c7"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Input: Classified valuation exception record, supporting processing results and the current SYS-FAP accounting and position state.
 
Handling: Coordinate the agreed corrective action with Valuation Operations and any other required owner. The action may include corrected valuation data, controlled reprocessing or reposting, an approved accounting adjustment or another documented NAV treatment. Implement or coordinate the action, retain supporting evidence and update the operational lifecycle tracker.
 
Output: Updated SYS-FAP accounting and position state, updated operational status and evidence of the implemented corrective action.]]></documentation>
