      <serviceTask name="Validate and process the submitted valuation file"
                    id="_9e3e5c71-7214-455f-ac01-d3956eb7971e"
                    isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_9e3e5c71-7214-455f-ac01-d3956eb7971e"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-VL-005; CSP-PP-006.
 
Input: Submitted FAP valuation file.
 
Handling: SYS-FAP performs its configured file-level and record-level validations and applies valuation records that meet its acceptance rules. Detailed ledger and posting logic are outside scope.
 
Output: File-level and record-level processing results, accepted valuations applied to the relevant positions, and available rejection or processing details for unsuccessful records.]]></documentation>
