      <serviceTask name="Produce the scheduled daily valuation file"
                    id="_b1185fdb-9738-4213-939a-5ee857f21238"
                    isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_b1185fdb-9738-4213-939a-5ee857f21238"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-VL-001.
 
Input: Current eligible FX Forward position population and applicable valuation inputs.
 
Handling: SYS-VAL identifies positions that it considers open and produces the scheduled file from its calculated valuation results. Internal valuation-model logic and market-data sourcing are outside scope.
 
Output: Scheduled daily valuation dile containing at least trade_id, trade_version, valuation date, valuation amount, valuation currency, and source timestamp.]]></documentation>
