      <exclusiveGateway name="Valuation file suitable for record-level processing?"
                         id="_b6175463-6464-486b-aee6-e43ec88250ea"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_b6175463-6464-486b-aee6-e43ec88250ea"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-VL-002; CSP-VQ-004.
 
Select Yes only when the expected valuation file is available and passes the file-level controls required to begin record-level population review.
 
Select No when the file is missing, late, unreadable, structurally invalid, associated with an incorrect valuation date, or lacks sufficient control information. Record-level missing valuations identified within an otherwise processable file follow the later valuation-population exception path.]]></documentation>
