      <exclusiveGateway name="Can the accounting or NAV impact be resolved before the applicable NAV cut-off?"
                         id="_c83f41a1-9f5d-412b-a331-b0eded461c57"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_c83f41a1-9f5d-412b-a331-b0eded461c57"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Decision: Determine whether the agreed corrective action has resolved the accounting or NAV impact before the applicable NAV cut-off.
 
Yes: Return the corrected result for another accounting and NAV impact review.
 
No: Document and escalate the unresolved accounting or NAV impact as an unsuccessful valuation outcome.]]></documentation>
