      <exclusiveGateway name="Can the affected valuations be corrected or resubmitted before the applicable NAV cut-off?"
                         id="_c9646eaf-259b-4653-a515-66655fe89482"
                         gatewayDirection="Diverging">
         <documentation id="documentation_c9646eaf-259b-4653-a515-66655fe89482"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Decision: Determine whether the required correction or controlled submission can be completed before the applicable NAV cut-off.
 
Yes: Prepare a corrected FAP valuation file and retry the submission.
 
No: Document and escalate the unresolved FAP processing exception for accounting and NAV impact assessment.]]></documentation>
