      <manualTask name="Document and escalate the unresolved FAP processing exception"
                   id="_d2f2d122-f645-47af-afc0-9010f9fe4ba8"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_d2f2d122-f645-47af-afc0-9010f9fe4ba8"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Input: FAP processing exception for which the affected valuations cannot be corrected or resubmitted before the applicable NAV cut-off.
 
Handling: Record the affected population, rejected or unapplied processing status, identified cause, supporting evidence, cut-off impact, assigned owner and required next action. Update the operational lifecycle tracker and notify Fund Accounting NAV Operations and any other required exception owner.
 
Output: Updated operational status, valuation exception record, investigation evidence and escalation for accounting and NAV impact assessment.]]></documentation>
