      <manualTask name="Investigate file-level completeness or timeliness exception"
                   id="_dd5bab13-29e5-46c5-88c2-a9c25892281b"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_dd5bab13-29e5-46c5-88c2-a9c25892281b"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-VL-002; CSP-PR-008; CSP-VQ-004.
 
Input: Scheduled valuation file and a failed file-level completeness or timeliness control.
 
Handling: Determine whether the expected valuation file is missing, late, incomplete or inconsistent with the expected population and control totals. Confirm the available source, batch and valuation-date information, coordinate the required investigation and retain supporting evidence.
 
Output: Confirmed file-level valuation excetpion and the required correction or replacement action, or an unresolved exception requiring escalation.
 ]]></documentation>
