      <manualTask name="Investigate and classify the accounting or NAV impact exception"
                   id="_def88062-fa85-4ca8-8d6b-9796dae06fc2"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_def88062-fa85-4ca8-8d6b-9796dae06fc2"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Input: Reviewed unrealised P&L and derivative accounting impact, FAP valuation processing results and the corresponding SYS-FAP accounting and position state.
 
Handling: Investigate the unacceptable accounting or NAV impact. Identify the affected valuation population, accounts and positions, determine the materiality and establish whether the cause relates to valuation data, processing state, accounting classification, posting or the required NAV treatment. Assign the responsible owner and required corrective action.
 
Output: Classified valuation exception record identifying the cause, affected population, accounting or NAV impact, assigned owner and required corrective action.]]></documentation>
