      <manualTask name="Coordinate correction or resubmission of affected valuations"
                   id="_e648b3fa-4e1b-4eca-a937-86d4ba35672a"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_e648b3fa-4e1b-4eca-a937-86d4ba35672a"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-003; CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-VQ-009.
 
Input: Classified valuation exception record and the corresponding FAP processing results.
 
Handling: Coordinate with the relevant data or system owner to determine whether the affected valuations require source-data correction, file reconstruction or controlled resubmission. Confirm dependencies, ownership and feasibility against the applicable NAV cut-off.
 
Output: Agreed recovery approach and an updated valuation exception record confirming whether the affected valuations can be corrected or resubmitted within the required time.
 
 ]]></documentation>
